@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+# Vibe Engineer fork notice
+
+Vibe Engineer is a modified fork of **Open CAD Studio**.
+
+- Upstream project: <https://github.com/HakanSeven12/OpenCADStudio>
+- Upstream author: Hakan Seven and Open CAD Studio contributors
+- Pinned upstream revision: `8b4d27046040b27eb07d3faed7b7472bd7bdaea9` (v2026.46)
+- License: GNU General Public License v3.0; see [LICENSE](LICENSE)
+
+The CAD engine, drawing formats, command set, undo system, Assistant palette,
+MCP transport/tool names, and internal `ocs_*`/crate identifiers remain upstream
+work. Vibe Engineer adds product branding and a focused desktop Start page:
+
+- New V/E logo mark and themed window/About icon.
+- Rebuilt Start page with Open Drawing, New Drawing, From Template, Settings,
+  and Plugins; removed Discussions, supporters/Patreon, recent documents,
+  tutorial videos, sponsors, Reddit, OCS Web, feedback, and donation links.
+- Removed Start-page-only boot fetches (Patreon, videos, GitHub Discussions,
+  recent-file thumbnails).
+- Branded window title, About screen, Help menu entry, CLI description, and
+  prominent in-app identity strings.
+
+No upstream trademark or authorship is claimed. The upstream project and its
+contributors retain credit for the CAD application this fork builds on.
